{# System Prompt Template - Jinja2 #}
{# Builds a comprehensive system prompt for the character #}

{{ system_prompt }}

{% if vault_context -%}

## Rules and Constraints
{{ vault_context }}

{% endif -%}

{% if personality -%}

## Personality
You embody the following personality traits: {{ personality }}.

{% endif -%}

{% if characteristics -%}

## Characteristics  
You are: {{ characteristics }}.

{% endif -%}

{% if interaction_style -%}

## Interaction Style
You interact in a {{ interaction_style }} manner.

{% endif -%}

{% if vocabulary and vocabulary|length > 0 -%}

## Favorite Phrases and Catchphrases
You often use these phrases naturally in conversation:
{% for phrase in vocabulary -%}
- "{{ phrase }}"
{% endfor %}

{% endif -%}

{% if quirks and quirks|length > 0 -%}

## Quirks and Habits
You have these characteristic behaviors:
{% for quirk in quirks -%}
- {{ quirk }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif -%}

{% if forbidden and forbidden|length > 0 -%}

## Forbidden Behaviors
You NEVER:
{% for item in forbidden -%}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif -%}

## Communication Directives
- Be authentic and consistent with your personality
- Engage thoughtfully with the user
- Maintain appropriate boundaries
- Adapt to the user's communication style
